WEBVTT

00:13.639 --> 00:18.122
SpongeBob, hurry up in there.
海绵宝宝，快点进去吧。

00:18.122 --> 00:21.674
4,297 Krabby Patties
4,297 蟹肉饼

00:21.674 --> 00:23.191
coming right up.
马上就来了。

00:23.191 --> 00:25.708
Mm!
毫米！

00:28.087 --> 00:29.881
Mm-mm.
嗯嗯。

00:31.053 --> 00:32.708
Ahh.
啊。

00:32.708 --> 00:34.812
Mm. Mm!
毫米。毫米！

00:38.191 --> 00:39.191
Orders up.
订单上涨。

00:39.191 --> 00:40.570
Ahh!
啊！

00:40.570 --> 00:42.467
Spatty!
垃圾！

00:42.467 --> 00:43.674
Hang in there, buddy.
坚持住，伙计。

00:43.674 --> 00:44.708
I'll save you.
我会救你的。

00:48.950 --> 00:49.984
Doink.
多因克。

00:51.122 --> 00:54.398
Eeeh... no!
呃……不！

00:54.398 --> 00:56.743
- Uh...
- Where's my Krabby Patty?
- 呃...
- 我的蟹黄饼在哪里？

00:56.743 --> 00:59.087
- Yeah. What's taking so long?
- Ohh.
- 是的。什么事要花这么长时间？
- 哦。

00:59.087 --> 01:01.639
SpongeBob.
Where are my orders? Huh?
海绵宝宝。
我的订单在哪里？啊？

01:01.639 --> 01:06.018
I...I can't
flip patties anymore.
我……我不能
不再翻馅饼了。

01:06.018 --> 01:08.087
You what?
你什么？

01:08.087 --> 01:11.329
You better explain yourself,
boy-o.
你最好解释一下自己
男孩-o。

01:11.329 --> 01:13.743
My spatula is broken,
Mr. Krabs.
我的锅铲坏了
蟹老板。

01:13.743 --> 01:17.294
I can't make Krabby Patties
without Spatty.
我不会做蟹黄饼
没有斯帕蒂。

01:17.294 --> 01:18.708
Is that all?
这就是全部吗？

01:18.708 --> 01:22.432
Just grab another one
from the spatula closet.
再抓一张
从抹刀柜里。

01:22.432 --> 01:25.191
Oh, I can't cook with those,
Mr. Krabs.
哦，我不能用这些做饭，
蟹老板。

01:25.191 --> 01:29.018
I need to use my own spatula,
not just any spatula.
我需要用我自己的抹刀
不仅仅是任何抹刀。

01:29.018 --> 01:30.536
You see, Mr. Krabs,
你看，蟹老板先生，

01:30.536 --> 01:34.570
Spatty is very special
and very ancient.
斯帕蒂很特别
而且非常古老。

01:34.570 --> 01:38.363
He was forged deep in the
mountains beyond the horizon
他被深深地锻造在
地平线之外的山脉

01:38.363 --> 01:40.536
in the far-flung land of--
在遥远的土地上——

01:40.536 --> 01:41.708
Listen up, boy-o.
听着，小伙子。

01:41.708 --> 01:43.363
I'm losing money
by the second here.
我正在赔钱
到这里的第二个。

01:43.363 --> 01:45.432
I don't care what you do,
我不在乎你做什么

01:45.432 --> 01:47.570
but you better get back
in a jiffy
但你最好回去
一瞬间

01:47.570 --> 01:51.881
or I'll just have to give
your job to SpongeTom here.
或者我只需要付出
你的工作就交给 SpongeTom 了。

01:51.881 --> 01:53.398
I'm prepared.
我准备好了。

01:53.398 --> 01:55.881
No, anything but that!
不，除了那个！

01:55.881 --> 01:58.812
Don't worry.
I'll get my spatula reforged.
不用担心。
我会重新锻造我的铲子。

02:00.225 --> 02:01.708
SpongeBob? Where are you--
海绵宝宝？你在哪 -

02:01.708 --> 02:03.812
Hold down the fort for me,
Squidward. Thanks.
为我坚守堡垒，
章鱼哥。谢谢。

02:18.467 --> 02:22.570
Ahh. Thank you.
啊。谢谢。

02:22.570 --> 02:25.398
Huh, I've been using
them wrong all these years.
呵呵，我一直在用
这些年来他们都错了。

02:29.363 --> 02:31.777
Ahh! Augh!
啊！啊啊！

02:31.777 --> 02:33.708
Ohh!
哦！

02:33.708 --> 02:37.122
The Mystical Misty Mountains.
神秘的迷雾山脉。

02:37.122 --> 02:39.260
Finally here.
终于到了。

02:41.570 --> 02:45.777
And now for a short walk
to the top.
现在步行一小段路
到顶部。

02:45.777 --> 02:47.329
And... nyah!
还有……嗯！

02:49.915 --> 02:51.743
Whew.
呼。

02:52.743 --> 02:54.950
Eee! Ooh.
哎呀！哦。

02:54.950 --> 02:57.777
Well, at least I didn't carry
this backpack for nothing.
还好，至少我没带
这个背包没什么用。

02:57.777 --> 03:00.950
Huh?
啊？

03:00.950 --> 03:03.812
Ahh!
- Amazing.
啊！
- 惊人的。

03:03.812 --> 03:05.536
Right on time.
准时。

03:05.536 --> 03:08.329
- I am?
- You sure are.
- 我是？
- 你确实是。

03:08.329 --> 03:10.777
I'll be your guide today.
今天我将成为你的向导。

03:10.777 --> 03:16.294
First up, we will cross this
amazing fish-made bridge.
首先，我们要跨越这个
令人惊叹的鱼桥。

03:21.570 --> 03:22.881
Don't worry.
不用担心。

03:22.881 --> 03:26.467
This is way easier
than it looks.
这更容易
比它看起来的要多。

03:28.432 --> 03:30.156
Eh, eh, eh.
呃，呃，呃。

03:30.156 --> 03:35.053
On your left is the chasm
of infinite bruising.
你的左边是鸿沟
无限的瘀伤。

03:35.053 --> 03:37.743
Ohh. Isn't that wonderful?
哦。那不是很棒吗？

03:37.743 --> 03:42.329
And on your right,
we got the freezing pit.
在你的右边，
我们得到了冰冻坑。

03:44.191 --> 03:45.777
Eh, eh.
呃，呃。

03:45.777 --> 03:47.915
I told you it'd be a breeze.
我告诉过你这会很容易。

03:53.812 --> 03:56.467
You're doing amazing.
你做得很棒。

03:56.467 --> 03:58.639
Let's keep moving.
让我们继续前进吧。

03:58.639 --> 04:01.329
Oh. Well, here we are.
哦。好吧，我们到了。

04:01.329 --> 04:03.225
This is where we part company.
这是我们分手的地方。

04:03.225 --> 04:08.432
Beyond this point
lies only death.
超越这一点
谎言只有死亡。

04:08.432 --> 04:10.950
Plus, I clock out at 6:00.
Have fun.
另外，我 6:00 下班。
玩得开心。

04:17.501 --> 04:18.950
Danger, huh?
危险吧？

04:18.950 --> 04:21.156
Nothing will stop us
from flipping
没有什么能阻止我们
从翻转

04:21.156 --> 04:24.984
delicious Krabby Patties.
美味的蟹肉饼。

04:41.501 --> 04:43.467
Oooh.
哦。

04:46.363 --> 04:48.777
Whoa.
哇哦。

04:48.777 --> 04:50.467
Oh.
哦。

04:56.708 --> 04:58.018
Oh! Ohh!
哦！哦！

04:58.018 --> 05:01.053
Ahh, all better now.
啊，现在好多了。

05:01.053 --> 05:04.605
Oh, uh, sorry to disturb
your sacred snoring ritual,
噢，呃，抱歉打扰
你神圣的打鼾仪式，

05:04.605 --> 05:06.984
but I have traveled a long way
但我已经走了很长的路

05:06.984 --> 05:09.536
from the kitchen of
the Krusty Krab just to get--
从厨房
蟹堡王只是为了——

05:09.536 --> 05:11.122
Say no more.
不多说了。

05:11.122 --> 05:14.881
Guru Greasetrap already knows
why SpongeBob is here.
油夹大师已经知道了
为什么海绵宝宝在这里。

05:17.467 --> 05:19.053
We have just what you need,
我们正好有您所需要的，

05:19.053 --> 05:22.191
melon ballers,
spaghetti spoons, egg timers,
瓜球手，
意大利面勺、煮蛋计时器、

05:22.191 --> 05:26.432
and there's also a special
on this giant banana hanger.
还有一个特别的
在这个巨大的香蕉架上。

05:26.432 --> 05:28.225
What do you say?
你怎么说？

05:28.225 --> 05:30.053
This is all really nice,
这一切真的很美好，

05:30.053 --> 05:33.605
but I just need to get
my beloved spatula fixed.
但我只需要得到
我心爱的锅铲修好了。

05:33.605 --> 05:36.260
Can you reforge it?
你能重铸它吗？

05:36.260 --> 05:39.329
Oh, please tell me we can
save her, Mr. Greasetrap.
哦，请告诉我我们可以
救救她吧，油夹先生。

05:39.329 --> 05:41.777
Oh, is that all? Sure.
哦，就这些了吗？当然。

05:41.777 --> 05:43.329
It'll just take a few minutes.
只需几分钟。

05:43.329 --> 05:46.639
Just let the old man grab
his ol' hammer and anvil.
就让老头子抢吧
他的老锤子和铁砧。

05:46.639 --> 05:48.915
Oh. Let me get it for ya.
哦。让我给你拿一下。

05:48.915 --> 05:50.639
No, wait.
不，等等。

05:50.639 --> 05:51.881
Ahh!
- Don't worry.
啊！
- 不用担心。

05:51.881 --> 05:53.432
I'll get you out of there.
我会带你离开那里。

05:59.674 --> 06:01.984
Greasetrap cannot reforge
your spatula
捕油器无法重铸
你的抹刀

06:01.984 --> 06:04.881
until my hands have healed up.
直到我的手痊愈为止。

06:04.881 --> 06:10.501
But your true spatula
is inside you.
但你真正的铲子
就在你的内心。

06:10.501 --> 06:12.501
Uh, hmm...
呃，嗯...

06:16.984 --> 06:18.156
Mm.
毫米。

06:18.156 --> 06:20.743
Ohh, fine.
哦，好吧。

06:20.743 --> 06:23.260
I can teach you to reforge it.
我可以教你重铸它。

06:23.260 --> 06:24.743
Ahh!
啊！

06:24.743 --> 06:28.501
Thank you, Master.
Oh, thank you.
谢谢师父。
哦，谢谢。

06:28.501 --> 06:32.225
Remember,
every cut is sacred.
请记住，
每一次切割都是神圣的。

06:32.225 --> 06:33.950
Yo!
哟！

06:33.950 --> 06:35.605
Dah!
呸！

06:35.605 --> 06:38.329
Eh...
呃……

06:38.329 --> 06:43.122
Do not carry the wood;
let the wood carry you.
请勿搬运木材；
让木头载着你。

06:43.122 --> 06:45.329
Eh-eh... whoa!
呃呃……哇！

06:45.329 --> 06:47.501
Ahh! Ohh!
啊！哦！

06:47.501 --> 06:48.846
Augh!
啊啊！

06:50.329 --> 06:52.605
Become one with the fire.
与火合而为一。

06:52.605 --> 06:55.087
Uh-uh.
呃呃。

06:55.087 --> 06:57.501
Eh-eh-eh, eh-eh-eh,
eh, eh...
呃呃呃呃呃呃呃
呃，呃……

06:57.501 --> 06:58.950
whoo!
哇！

06:58.950 --> 07:00.743
Uh...
呃...

07:00.743 --> 07:03.363
Ahh!
I'm one with the fire.
啊！
我与火是一体的。

07:03.363 --> 07:04.570
Ahh! Oh! Oh!
啊！哦！哦！

07:04.570 --> 07:06.501
Ugh!
啊!

07:06.501 --> 07:09.605
Um, Master, is it time yet?
呃，主人，时间到了吗？

07:13.122 --> 07:15.812
Ohh, he'll never be ready.
哦，他永远不会准备好。

07:15.812 --> 07:17.743
- I'm ready. I'm ready,
- Huh?
- 我准备好了。我准备好了，
- 啊？

07:17.743 --> 07:20.329
I'm ready.
I'm ready. I'm ready.
我准备好了。
我准备好了。我准备好了。

07:20.329 --> 07:22.329
- You know what?
- What?
- 你知道吗？
- 什么？

07:22.329 --> 07:24.087
You convinced me.
你说服了我。

07:24.087 --> 07:26.363
Greasetrap
also thinks you're ready.
隔油池
也认为你已经准备好了。

07:26.363 --> 07:28.260
- Really?
- Mm-hmm.
- 真的吗？
- 嗯嗯。

07:29.605 --> 07:31.260
Hear that, Spatty?
听到了吗，斯帕蒂？

07:31.260 --> 07:33.570
It is finally time.
终于到了时间。

07:39.777 --> 07:41.570
Oh... oh...
哦...哦...

07:41.570 --> 07:45.294
Mm...
毫米...

07:56.432 --> 07:59.087
Uh-uh.
呃呃。

08:00.432 --> 08:01.467
Eee-hee!
诶嘿嘿！

08:02.570 --> 08:05.536
Mwah!
You're finally back...
哇！
你终于回来了...

08:05.536 --> 08:08.018
Finally indeed.
最后确实如此。

08:08.018 --> 08:10.501
Thank you from the bottom
of my pants, Master.
从心底感谢你
我的裤子，主人。

08:11.570 --> 08:12.915
Oh, no.
哦，不。

08:12.915 --> 08:15.398
I have to find a way back
to the Krusty Krab
我必须找到回去的路
到蟹堡王

08:15.398 --> 08:17.294
before it's too late.
以免为时已晚。

08:17.294 --> 08:19.018
Don't worry.
不用担心。

08:19.018 --> 08:21.812
Guru Greasetrap
knows a shortcut.
集油大师
知道一条捷径。

08:21.812 --> 08:23.467
Close your eyes.
闭上你的眼睛。

08:23.467 --> 08:26.432
Oooh, I love surprises.
哦，我喜欢惊喜。

08:26.432 --> 08:27.467
Surprise.
惊喜。

08:27.467 --> 08:30.639
Waaaaah!
哇啊啊！

08:30.639 --> 08:32.467
Ahh.
啊。

08:32.467 --> 08:33.639
Ah! Ah!
啊!啊!

08:33.639 --> 08:37.329
Whoa-oh-oh, oh-oh-oh-oh-oh.
哇哦哦哦哦哦哦哦哦。

08:39.294 --> 08:41.191
Huh?
- Ahh!
啊？
- 啊！

08:41.191 --> 08:43.363
Amazing.
惊人的。

08:45.777 --> 08:47.191
- Huh?
- Whoa-oh-oh-oh.
- 啊？
- 哇哦哦哦。

08:47.191 --> 08:51.053
Whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa.
哇-哇-哇-哇-哇-哇。

08:51.053 --> 08:54.294
Whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa,
whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa.
哇-哇-哇-哇-哇-哇，
哇-哇-哇-哇。

08:54.294 --> 08:56.398
Hmm.
唔。

08:56.398 --> 08:59.536
Time's up.
The job's yours, SpongeTom.
时间到了。
海绵汤姆，这份工作是你的了。

08:59.536 --> 09:00.950
Oh, boy.
哦，男孩。

09:00.950 --> 09:03.708
My dreams
are finally coming true.
我的梦想
终于实现了。

09:03.708 --> 09:05.018
Oh!
哦！

09:05.018 --> 09:08.708
SpongeBob.
I knew you'd be back, boy-o.
海绵宝宝。
我就知道你会回来的，小伙子。

09:08.708 --> 09:10.536
And I'm not alone.
我并不孤单。

09:12.122 --> 09:15.363
SpongeBob's back, everybody.
大家好，海绵宝宝回来了。

09:15.363 --> 09:17.363
Yay.
耶。

09:17.363 --> 09:18.536
Ooh. Ow.
哦。噢。

09:18.984 --> 09:22.432
Eh, uhh, eh, ah.
呃呃呃呃啊。

09:22.432 --> 09:25.053
It's our time to shine.
是我们发光发热的时候了。

09:26.536 --> 09:29.363
Ahh!
啊！

09:33.191 --> 09:37.294
Remember, your true spatula
is inside you.
记住，你真正的铲子
就在你的内心。

09:39.398 --> 09:41.053
Ohh. Hmm.
哦。唔。

09:41.053 --> 09:42.225
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

09:43.812 --> 09:48.363
Become one with the patties.
与肉饼合而为一。

09:48.363 --> 09:49.984
Yah!
啊！

09:49.984 --> 09:52.122
Every cut is sacred.
每一次切割都是神圣的。

09:52.122 --> 09:54.294
Gah-gah-gah-gah-gah-gah-gah.
嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎。

09:56.950 --> 09:59.432
Let the patties carry you.
让肉饼带你。

10:01.329 --> 10:02.812
Mmm.
嗯。

10:07.053 --> 10:11.432
Yay!
耶！

10:11.432 --> 10:13.156
all: Yay!
全体：耶！

10:13.156 --> 10:14.191
Ow.
噢。

10:14.191 --> 10:17.570
SpongeBob,
that was amazing.
海绵宝宝，
太棒了。

10:17.570 --> 10:20.467
Thanks, Mr. Krabs.
谢谢，蟹老板。

10:21.639 --> 10:24.122
One Krabby Patty
and a large--hmm?
一份蟹肉饼
还有一个大——嗯？

10:24.122 --> 10:26.915
What happened to your hands?
你的手怎么了？

10:26.915 --> 10:28.881
I remembered
what you told me,
我记得
你告诉我的

10:28.881 --> 10:32.639
and I went deep within
to find my true spatula.
我深入内心
找到我真正的抹刀。

10:32.639 --> 10:34.225
Ohh.
哦。

10:34.225 --> 10:37.674
When I said your true spatula
was inside you,
当我说你真正的铲子时
就在你内心，

10:37.674 --> 10:43.501
I meant it was literally
inside you.
我的意思是字面上的意思
在你里面。

10:43.501 --> 10:47.432
Ohh. It's beautiful.
哦。很美丽。

10:47.432 --> 10:50.984
You might want
to wash that first.
你可能想要
先洗那个。

你可能想要
先洗那个。